}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to consider something; to examine something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm looking into applying to university next year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about your plans for the future."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "culinary school"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an institution where you learn how to cook professionally"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm thinking of applying to a culinary school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "academy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place of study or training in a specific subject"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Blue Ribbon Academy is a great culinary school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scholarship"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sum of money you receive for studies"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This university offers good scholarships."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "creative writing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a subject where you learn how to write stories, drama, or poetry"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am planning to study creative writing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to further"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to continue doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is planning to further his business studies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "intention "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a plan"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have no intention of furthering my studies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to wonder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to want to know something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I wonder how John is."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le02ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Plans for Studies"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about your intentions and plans for your studies, you can use the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Continous</span>, <span class=\"strong\"> be going to </span> and expressions like <span class=\"italic\">I'm thinking of studying \u2026</span> or  <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to \u2026</span><br><br>  If you have no plans, you can use an expression like<span class=\"italic\"> I have no intention of ...</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I'm thinking of studying cooking at the culinary school.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I have no intention of furthering my studies."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Intentions and Plans\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subjects to Study\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm thinking of studying \u2026<br> I'm looking into applying to \u2026<br> I'm going to study \u2026<br> I'm planning to study ...<br> </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">cooking<br> art, music<br> creative writing<br> business</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br/><br/><span class = \\\"strong\\\">Interrogative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Are you going to the movie?<br/>Will you be going to the game?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Affirmative \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I will be going to the movies.<br/>I will be going to the game.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of what you are hoping or planning to do next year."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5-8 sentences about your plans and intentions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say the sentences aloud to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to do the same. Listen to your partner's plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk together about what is similar and what is different."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about plans and intentions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements about my plans for next year."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner's future plans and make comparisons."}]}]}